/**
 * The online kit of "Construir com IA" (volume 10), as data. The page is
 * pages/BookKit.jsx, at /books/construir-com-ia/kit.
 *
 * Written on 23/10/2026 from the 0.9.1 book. Unlike the task kits of volumes
 * 1 to 9, this book builds one system, a step per chapter, so the kit has two
 * parts the others do not: SYSTEM, the reader's system filled in once, whose
 * values go into every prompt that names it; and TRAIL, the fifteen steps,
 * each with the chapter's "Pronto quando" lines to tick.
 *
 * TASKS and TRAIL are generated by script from the chapters, never retyped:
 * every prompt is the code block printed in the chapter, word for word, the
 * print line breaks joined except where a line starts a list item or follows
 * the end of a sentence (the status text of chapter 13 keeps its three
 * lines). Each bracket is a field whose placeholder is the bracket's text;
 * the six brackets that name the reader's system ("[nome do sistema]",
 * "[sistema]", "[as três palavras]"...) come from SYSTEM instead, so an
 * empty one prints the SYSTEM placeholder, not the chapter's exact words.
 * The two "[hora]" of the status text are two fields, the hour it fell and
 * the hour of the next notice. Whoever edits a prompt here checks it against
 * the chapter.
 *
 * This edition of the book ran no tests: no task carries a test result, and
 * the kit says nothing an agent did. The step text of each trail item is the
 * chapter's own "O passo é" sentence or the step clause of its promise. A
 * time line drops a sentence that points at the chapter's page ("o quadro
 * acima"), which the kit does not have.
 */

